{
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "autoloader-generic",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "The app ships no composer/autoload.php, so the server registers its generic loader for lib/ and looks every class up in the file system.",
        "  A composer/composer.json with config.vendor-dir \".\", config.optimize-autoloader true, a config.autoloader-suffix and autoload.psr-4 {\"OCA\\\\GroceryList\\\\\": \"../lib/\"} makes composer dump-autoload write composer/autoload.php with a class map; the code of the app does not change."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-tools-in-root",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "vimeo/psalm, phpunit/phpunit are in require-dev of composer.json. The manual recommends a vendor-bin/ of bamarni/composer-bin-plugin per tool, so that the dependencies of a tool cannot conflict with those of the app."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ocp-deprecated",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Controller/GroceryListController.php:601 OCP\\Collaboration\\Collaborators\\ISearch::search(): deprecated since Nextcloud 35; Use filteredSearch instead."
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 use in 1 file of the public API that is deprecated in Nextcloud 33 to 35. The text of the tag names the replacement where it has one.",
        "  lib/Controller/GroceryListController.php:601 OCP\\Collaboration\\Collaborators\\ISearch::search(): deprecated since Nextcloud 35; Use filteredSearch instead."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "transaction-manual",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Db/CategoryMapper.php:63",
        "lib/Service/ListService.php:34"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "2 transactions are opened and closed by hand. The trait TTransactional has atomic() since Nextcloud 24 and atomicRetry() since Nextcloud 27, which repeats a transaction that ran into a deadlock, as the manual recommends.",
        "  lib/Db/CategoryMapper.php:63",
        "  lib/Service/ListService.php:34"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "time-direct",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Controller/GroceryListController.php:99 time()",
        "lib/Controller/GroceryListController.php:351 time()",
        "lib/Db/ItemMapper.php:64 time()",
        "lib/Db/ItemMapper.php:86 time()"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "lib/ reads the clock directly in 4 places. OCP\\AppFramework\\Utility\\ITimeFactory, a PSR-20 ClockInterface, gives the same time and can be replaced in a test.",
        "  lib/Controller/GroceryListController.php:99 time()",
        "  lib/Controller/GroceryListController.php:351 time()",
        "  lib/Db/ItemMapper.php:64 time()",
        "  lib/Db/ItemMapper.php:86 time()"
      ],
      "folds": [
        {
          "at": 4,
          "count": 1
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
